  tenNhiemVu: "Huy\u1EBFt S\xE1t Ngo\u1EA1i \xD4"
  loaiQuest: 0
  idQuaiCanDiet: 1
  soLuongBoXuongCanDiet: 1000
  idDoiTuongCanGiaiCuu: 0
  soLuongCanGiaiCuu: 1
  loiThoaiNhanQuest: "Luy\u1EC7n Ng\u1EE5c \u0111\xE3 ch\xECm ho\xE0n to\xE0n trong
    bi\u1EC3n m\xE1u! Ma kh\xED cu\u1ED3ng b\u1EA1o l\xE0m h\xE0ng \u0111\u1ED1ng
    t\xE0n c\u1ED1t t\u1EEB chi\u1EBFn tr\u01B0\u1EDDng c\u1ED5 s\u1ED1ng l\u1EA1i,
    l\u1EADp th\xE0nh nh\u1EEFng binh \u0111o\xE0n x\u01B0\u01A1ng kh\xF4 tr\xE0n
    ra c\u1EAFn x\xE9. \u0110\u1EA1o h\u1EEFu, mau vung ki\u1EBFm m\u1EDF \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
    m\xE1u, di\u1EC7t s\u1EA1ch l\u0169 c\u1ED1t binh n\xE0y"
  loiThoaiDangLam: "L\u0169 x\u01B0\u01A1ng kh\xF4 Luy\u1EC7n Ng\u1EE5c \u0111\xF4ng
    nh\u01B0 ki\u1EBFn v\xE0 c\u1EF1c k\u1EF3 t\xE0n b\u1EA1o! \u0110\u1EA1o h\u1EEFu
    ch\u1EDB l\u01A1i tay, h\xE3y t\u1EADp trung linh l\u1EF1c h\u1EA1 g\u1EE5c \u0111\u1EE7
    s\u1ED1 l\u01B0\u1EE3ng t\xE0n c\u1ED1t cu\u1ED3ng b\u1EA1o n\xE0y"
  loiThoaiHoanThanh: "S\xE1t kh\xED c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1EA1o h\u1EEFu \u0111\xE3 \xE1t
    c\u1EA3 bi\u1EC3n m\xE1u! \u0110\u1EE3t s\xF3ng c\u1ED1t binh \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn
    \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB \u0111\u1EADp tan. C\u1EA7m l\u1EA5y t\xE0i nguy\xEAn n\xE0y
    \u0111\u1EC3 chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB cho tr\u1EADn t\xE0n s\xE1t ti\u1EBFp theo!"
